CM_ "toyota_townace.dbc - Toyota Town Ace (2025, Taiwan) powertrain + chassis CAN, 500 kbps";
CM_ "Made 2026-11-17 from openpilot branch 2955 daihatsu_granmax_generated.dbc (802309d2f).";
CM_ "The Town Ace is the Toyota badge of the Daihatsu Gran Max (S403/S413); the Gran Max";
CM_ "DBC was itself built from a Town Ace highway capture (220676 frames, 69 IDs).";
CM_ "Changes from the Gran Max DBC, all measured on the car with lowcostPedal t10b_can_signals:";
CM_ "  TRANSMISSION.GEAR now covers all of byte 1 (R N D 2 L), PARK added (byte 0 bit 0).";
CM_ "  HANDBRAKE.HANDBRAKE_ENGAGED moved to byte 0 bit 0 (the old one sat on the checksum).";
CM_ "  WHEEL_SPEED_CLEAN.WHEELSPEED moved to bytes 5-6 (the old 13-bit field overflowed).";
CM_ "  MSG_199 renamed SPEED_2 with the speed in bytes 3-4.";
CM_ "Frame checksum is the Toyota scheme (file name starts with toyota_ so opendbc uses it).";
CM_ "MSG_xxx entries are not decoded. Scales not marked verified are still Ativa values.";

